@startuml
title Step 4 - Validation of the Product Order items

actor person
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM
participant "ProductOrderCapture\n& Validation" as POCV
participant "ProductConfigurator" as PC
participant "ProductInventory" as PI

activate EM
activate POCV

== get final approval of order configuration ==

EM -> POCV : 60 **TMF622 Product Order Mgt** GET /productOrder/7\nor **TMF663 Shopping Cart Mgt** GET /shoppingCart/7
POCV --> EM : 61 **TMF622** 200 OK\nproductOrder #7\nor **TMF663** 200 OK\nshoppingCart #7

EM -> EM : 62 Display all items and tariff
person --> EM : 63 confirm global approval
EM -> POCV : 64 **TMF701 Process** PATCH /process/4/task/4\nSessionId, validate Order OK

opt
    POCV -> PI : 65 **TMF637 Product Inventory Mgt** POST /product
    activate PI
    PI --> POCV : 66 **TMF637** 201 Created\nProduct representation
    deactivate PI
end

note over POCV
  At this point the shopping cart is not anymore used
  shift to Product Order entity necessary
end note

alt if shoppingCart API is used
    POCV -> POCV : 67 **TMF663 Shopping Cart Mgt** PATCH /shoppingCart/7\n(change status to ordered)
    POCV -> POCV : 68 **TMF622 Product Order Mgt** POST /productOrder\n(draft, from shoppingCart7)
else if shoppingCart API is not used
    POCV -> POCV : 69 **TMF622 Product Order Mgt** PATCH productOrder/7\n(draft)
end
deactivate POCV
deactivate EM

@enduml
